if {nameChange} == true:
	the_wall: What then must we call [wave]You[/wave]?
	[text_input var="playerName"]
	[signal arg="name_changed"]
	jump TW_first_greet_1/confirm_name
else:
	the_wall: As it was Foretold
the_wall: {playerName}, heed this Transmission\:
the_wall: There is something beyond nothing
A start in the end
Walls only serve to block the other side.
For ███ ████ of your Universe is not The End
[signal arg="dialogue_done"]